column2:
May Govinda protect me in the east, Madhusudana in the south, the god Shridhara in the west and Keshava in the north;
brahmapuran:60:41	may Vishnu protect me in the south-east, the imperishable Madhava in the south-west, Hrishikesha in the north-west and Vamana in the north-east;
brahmapuran:60:42	may Varaha protect me on the earth, and Trivikrama above. Having made this armour, one should then contemplate oneself:

Victory, victory, protector of the worlds, protector of devotees; victory, victory, loving to the humble; victory, victory, whose feet are the elements; victory, victory, primal god, cause of many; victory, victory, Vasudeva; victory, victory, destroyer of Asuras; victory, victory, divine Fish; victory, victory, best of the gods; victory, victory, lying on the ocean. Victory, victory, best of yogins; victory, victory, sun-eyed; victory, victory, king of gods; victory, victory, enemy of Kaitabha; victory, victory, best of the Vedas; victory, victory, Tortoise in form; victory, victory, best of sacrifices; victory, victory, lotus-naveled; victory, victory, mountain-dweller. Victory, victory, lying in yoga; victory, victory, bearer of speed; victory, victory, universal form; victory, victory, discus-bearer; victory, victory, lord of beings; victory, victory, upholder of the earth; victory, victory, lying on Shesha; victory, victory, clad in yellow; victory, victory, lovely as the moon. Victory, victory, dwelling in yoga; victory, victory, fire-mouthed; victory, victory, dwelling of dharma; victory, victory, treasury of virtues; victory, victory, abode of Shri; victory, victory, riding Garuda; victory, victory, dwelling of happiness; victory, victory, banner of dharma; victory, victory, dwelling in the earth. Victory, victory, of profound deeds; victory, victory, reached by yogins; victory, victory, dwelling in sacrifice; victory, victory, known through the Vedas; victory, giver of peace; victory, victory, meditated on by yogins; victory, victory, giver of nourishment; victory, victory, embodiment of knowledge; victory, victory, mine of lotuses. Victory, victory, known by feeling; victory, victory, giver of liberation; victory, victory, of spotless body; victory, victory, abode of sattva; victory, victory, rich in virtues; victory, victory, maker of sacrifice; victory, victory, without qualities; victory, victory, giver of liberation; victory, victory, refuge of the earth. Victory, victory, full of radiance; victory, victory, refuge of the worlds; victory, victory, joined with Lakshmi; victory, victory, lotus-eyed; victory, victory, maker of creation; victory, victory, joined with yoga; victory, victory, whose body is dark as the atasi flower; victory, victory, whose body is pervaded by the ocean; victory, victory, bee at the lotus of Lakshmi. Victory, victory, subject to devotees; victory, victory, beloved of the world; victory, victory, supremely tranquil; victory, victory, supreme essence; victory, victory, discus-bearer; victory, victory, joined with the serpent; victory, victory, clad in blue; victory, victory, giver of peace; victory, victory, giver of liberation; victory, victory, remover of impurity.
brahmapuran:65:50	Victory, Krishna, lord of the world; victory, younger brother of Sankarshana; victory, lotus-eyed one; victory, giver of the fruit of wishes;
brahmapuran:65:51	victory, you whose chest is covered with the garland; victory, bearer of discus and mace; victory, beloved of the lotus-dwelling one; victory, Vishnu — salutation to you!
